    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nature Picross</strong> is a relaxing puzzle game where logic and deduction bring nature-themed pixel art to life. Solve 100 handcrafted puzzles, then keep the challenge going with endlessly generated puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my first game as an indie developer, inspired by my longtime love of picross puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music and additional sound effect by Chris Lodgson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These logic puzzles are also called griddlers, paint by numbers, hanjie, and nonograms.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nature Picross</strong> is a relaxing puzzle game where logic and deduction bring nature-themed pixel art to life. Solve 100 handcrafted puzzles, then keep the challenge going with endlessly generated puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my first game as an indie developer, inspired by my longtime love of picross puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music and additional sound effect by Chris Lodgson.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These logic puzzles are also called griddlers, paint by numbers, hanjie, and nonograms.</p>",
